

r --> read (4)
w --> write (2)
x --> execute (1)
- -> no vlaue (0)


_ rwx rwx rwx
1  2   3   4


1 --> tells which type either file or folder
      -  --> file
      d  --> directory
2 --> user permissions
3 --> group permissions
4 --> others permissions


chmod 777 file_name  --> to change permissions to a file


chmod +x file_name  --> to add execute permissions to existing permissions


chmod 743 folder  --> to change permiisions to folder alone


chmod 761 folder/*  --> to change permissions inside folder, not for folder


chmod 755 folder -R  --> to change permissions to folder along with files in it
